.TH GRAPHSYNCD 1 "November 2026" "plasma-graphsync-linux @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
graphsyncd \- sync service of Graph Sync, the OneDrive and SharePoint sync client for KDE Plasma
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B graphsyncd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B graphsyncd
keeps the sync locations of all accounts in step with OneDrive and SharePoint through Microsoft
Graph, and serves the tray widget, the app, the System Settings page and the Dolphin plugins.
It runs once per user as the systemd user service
.B plasma-graphsync-linux.service
and is also started on demand through D-Bus (io.github.nvaert1986.GraphSync). It is not meant to be
started by hand.
.PP
Each location syncs with its own account; a signed-out account stops only its own locations. The
service watches the local folders, listens for Microsoft's change notifications and checks
everything regularly. On SIGTERM it saves the state of every location and stops.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/graphsyncrc
Settings and locations.
.TP
.I ~/.config/graphaccountsrc
Accounts, shared with the other apps of the suite.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/graphsync/
Sync state per location (owner only).
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/plasma-graphsync-linux/socket
State of files for the Dolphin emblems.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
Messages go to the journal:
.B journalctl \-\-user \-t graphsyncd
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR graphsyncctl (1),
.BR plasma\-graphsync\-linux (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
